{"step_index":764,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T18:11:56Z","content":"### Deep Root Cause Analysis & Fixes:\n\n1. **Root Cause Identified (Bootloader Stall):**\n   - In `App.tsx`, the root component was wrapped in a blocking `if (!dbReady)` state gate that displayed a background `#0F172A` loading screen while awaiting legacy database bootstrapping. If browser storage had any stale list data from earlier testing sessions, it held the app in that blank screen.\n2. **Defensive Storage & Cache Resilience:**\n   - Updated `WebDatabase.loadFromStorage` so that any legacy cached data is safely sanitized and always guaranteed to return clean arrays without throwing.\n3. **Added Top-Level Root ErrorBoundary:**\n   - Wrapped the entire application in a root `ErrorBoundary` so that any unexpected runtime issue will render diagnostic feedback instead of a silent blank screen.\n4. **Immediate Non-Blocking Mount:**\n   - Removed the loading screen gate from `App.tsx` completely. The navigation stack and dashboard now mount immediately.\n\n---\n\n### Rebuilt & Deployed Live to Surge:\n👉 **[https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh](https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh)**\n\n---\n\n### To Test on Your iPhone:\n1. Open Safari on your iPhone and go to **`https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh`** (or refresh your home screen app).\n2. The **SnapDialer** dashboard will load immediately with your educator pipeline, search bar, and 1-tap **\"Snap Sheet\"** / **\"Start Power Dialing\"** buttons!"}
